00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:26.208
A groove catches. The blue driver still crosses the shear line.

00:00:26.208 --> 00:00:28.167
The core supports the driver at pin 3. Its lower pin can drop away.

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:29.583
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:29.583 --> 00:00:31.000
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.417
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:32.417 --> 00:00:33.958
The pair lifts together and springs back. The hook moves one pin farther in.

00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:34.292
The hook meets resistance at pin 5.

00:00:34.292 --> 00:00:35.042
A groove catches. The blue driver still crosses the shear line.

00:00:35.042 --> 00:00:37.625
Pin 5 sets. The core turns farther and catches on pin 4.

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:39.042
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:39.042 --> 00:00:40.458
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:40.458 --> 00:00:42.000
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:42.583
Pin 4 still blocks the core. Its wide lower end is below the shear line.

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:43.458
The widening shoulder pushes the core back as the hook lifts.

00:00:43.458 --> 00:00:44.625
The core moves back under pin 5. Its spring pushes the driver down.

00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:45.500
The waist is past. A groove near the base gives one more catch before the driver clears.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.750
The core supports the driver at pin 4. Its lower pin can drop away.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.167
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:50.583
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.000
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.542
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:53.542 --> 00:00:53.875
The hook meets resistance at pin 5.

00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:54.625
A groove catches. The blue driver still crosses the shear line.

00:00:54.625 --> 00:00:54.875
The core supports the driver at pin 5. Its lower pin can drop away.

00:00:54.875 --> 00:00:57.208
As pin 5 clears, the core turns farther. Pin 6 stops it before the lock can open.

00:00:57.208 --> 00:00:58.625
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:00.042
The lower pin has free play. The blue driver stays above it.

